      "Nickel 201": "UNS N02201 (2.4061 / 2.4068) – Low-carbon variant of Nickel 200 specifically engineered for service at temperatures exceeding 315°C (600°F). Lower carbon content prevents embrittlement caused by intergranular carbon precipitation in high-heat applications."
