      "Inconel 601": "UNS N06601 (2.4851) – Features additional aluminum content providing enhanced resistance to high-temperature oxidation and spalling, even under severely cyclic heating conditions.",
      "Inconel 625": "UNS N06625 (2.4856) – Derives high strength and fatigue resistance from molybdenum and niobium addition. Highly resistant to pitting and crevice corrosion in seawater and chloride-heavy process streams.",
