      "Incoloy 800HT": "UNS N08811 (1.4876) – Optimized version with strictly controlled composition for maximum creep-rupture strength at high temperatures.",
      "Incoloy 825": "UNS N08825 (2.4858) – Titanium-stabilized alloy with added molybdenum and copper. Exceptional resistance to sulfuric and phosphoric acids. Virtually immune to chloride-ion stress corrosion cracking.",
