      "Monel K500": "UNS N05500 (2.4375) – Age-hardenable alloy combining excellent corrosion resistance with greater strength and hardness. Provides approximately three times the yield strength of Alloy 400. Remains non-magnetic down to very low temperatures. Spark-resistant for use in volatile environments.",
