      "Incoloy 800HT": "UNS N08811 (1.4859) – Enhanced version of 800H with optimized chemistry for maximum creep-rupture strength at elevated temperatures.",
      "Incoloy DS (Alloy 330)": "UNS N08330 – Specialized for heat-treating industry with increased silicon content. Superior resistance to 'green rot' and internal oxidation in carburizing and nitriding atmospheres. Maintains excellent ductility after long-term high-temperature service."
