      "Super Duplex S32760": "UNS S32760 (1.4410 / 1.4501) – Zeron 100 / Super Duplex F55. Similar to S32750 with deliberate additions of Copper and Tungsten. Enhances resistance to mineral acids like sulfuric and hydrochloric acid, particularly in contaminated media."
