      "Duplex S32205": "UNS S32205 (1.4462 / F60 / 2205) – Nitrogen-enhanced version of S31803. Dual certified with S31803, offering improved mechanical properties and corrosion resistance.",
      "Super Duplex S32750": "UNS S32750 (1.4410 / F53 / 2507) – Highly alloyed grade with 25% Chromium and 4% Molybdenum. PREN > 40, designed for high-strength applications in extremely corrosive conditions such as warm seawater.",
