      "Chemical Processing: Heat exchangers and piping systems handling halides and various organic acids",
      "Flue Gas Desulfurization (FGD): Scrubbers and chimney liners to resist corrosive condensates",
      "Food and Beverage: Equipment handling highly salted food products or aggressive cleaning agents",
