    technicalOverview:
      "Raymond Ispat India is a prominent and reliable manufacturer of Copper Nickel Alloy 70/30 Pipes and UNS C71500 Pipes in Mumbai. These pipes are crafted from a high-end alloy consisting of 70% copper and 30% nickel, with additional elements like manganese, iron, zinc, and lead added in precise percentages to ensure structural integrity. Available in a wide variety of lengths, diameters, and sizes, our Cu-Ni 70/30 industrial pipes are manufactured using premium raw materials to guarantee a superior finished product. This specific 70-30 ratio is identified for its high performance in marine environments, offering a robust alternative for systems requiring higher strength and better resistance to thermal stress. The mechanical and physical properties of Copper Nickel 70/30 pipes include high density, a higher melting point, and significant tensile and yield strength. The increased nickel content dramatically improves corrosion resistance at heat, making these pipes essential for high-temperature situations where structural stability is mandatory. Beyond their cost-effectiveness, the pipes are highly resistant to oxidation and provide a reliable barrier against general decay. They are characterized by excellent toughness and a fine surface finish, ensuring accuracy in demanding engineering applications where precision is non-negotiable.",

