      "Premium Stainless Steel 904L (UNS N08904 / 1.4539) high-alloy austenitic pipes engineered for severe corrosive media, featuring exceptional resistance to strong reducing acids, particularly sulfuric acid. Manufactured to ASTM A312, A358 and ASME SA312, SA358 standards.",

    technicalOverview:
      "RCM Metal & Alloy is a premier manufacturer and supplier of high-performance Stainless Steel 904L Pipes in Mumbai, specifically engineered for environments involving severe corrosive media. Grade 904L (UNS N08904) is a high-alloy, low-carbon, non-stabilized austenitic stainless steel that incorporates significant amounts of copper, nickel, and molybdenum. The addition of copper is a critical feature, providing the alloy with exceptional resistance to strong reducing acids, particularly varying concentrations of sulfuric acid. Furthermore, the high nickel and molybdenum content ensures these pipes are non-magnetic and provide superior protection against stress corrosion cracking and localized attacks like chloride pitting and crevice corrosion. Our comprehensive inventory includes Jindal Stainless Steel 904L pipes, available in seamless, welded, ERW, and EFW configurations. These industrial-grade pipes are manufactured in multiple forms, including round, square, rectangular, oval, and hydraulic profiles, tailored to meet specific customer requirements in terms of size, length, and technical specifications. The material exhibits robust mechanical properties, including high tensile and yield strength, alongside excellent toughness and formability. Because of its low carbon content, SS 904L also boasts fantastic weldability, allowing for secure and durable fabrication in complex industrial systems without the risk of sensitization.",

